{"step_index":72,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-02T21:44:37Z","content":"# Law Enforcement Intelligence Platform — FastAPI Backend\n\nThis is a complete, standalone, production-ready FastAPI backend application engineered for a law enforcement intelligence platform. It features:\n- **CORS Middleware** configured for secure frontend integrations (Vite/React).\n- **Neo4j Database Session Dependency** with lifecycle management and connection pooling.\n- **Header-Based RBAC Enforcement** (`X-Auth-Token`) restricting access to personnel with the `investigator` role.\n- **Graph Topology Serialization** converting Neo4j Cypher results (`MATCH (n) OPTIONAL MATCH (n)-[r]->(m)`) into the exact Cytoscape.js elements specification (`id`, `source`, `target`, `label`).\n- **Automated Anomaly Detection Engine Mock** returning prioritized syndication alerts (smurfing, burner phone rotations, layering).\n\n---\n\n### Architecture & Security Flow\n\n```\n                      ┌────────────────────────────────────────┐\n                      │    Frontend Client (React/Vite)        │\n                      └───────────────────┬────────────────────┘\n                                          │ HTTP GET + X-Auth-Token\n                                          ▼\n                      ┌────────────────────────────────────────┐\n                      │            CORS Middleware             │\n                      │  Validates Origin, Headers, & Methods  │\n                      └───────────────────┬────────────────────┘\n                                          │\n                                          ▼\n                      ┌────────────────────────────────────────┐\n                      \n<truncated 22227 bytes>\nst 0.0.0.0 --port 8000 --reload\n```\n\n#### 2. Test Authorization & RBAC Enforcement\n\n| Scenario | Request | Expected Status | Result |\n| :--- | :--- | :---: | :--- |\n| **Missing Header** | `curl -i http://localhost:8000/api/network` | `401 Unauthorized` | Rejects unauthenticated traffic |\n| **Invalid Token** | `curl -i -H \"X-Auth-Token: invalid-token\" http://localhost:8000/api/network` | `401 Unauthorized` | Rejects unrecognized credentials |\n| **Non-Investigator Role** | `curl -i -H \"X-Auth-Token: token-analyst-01\" http://localhost:8000/api/network` | `403 Forbidden` | Blocks analyst from investigator endpoint |\n| **Investigator Role** | `curl -i -H \"X-Auth-Token: token-investigator-01\" http://localhost:8000/api/network` | `200 OK` | Delivers Cytoscape.js graph payload |\n\n#### 3. Sample Response Payloads\n\n##### `GET /api/network` (Cytoscape.js Format)\n```json\n{\n  \"elements\": [\n    {\n      \"data\": {\n        \"id\": \"p1\",\n        \"label\": \"Viktor 'The Ghost' Vance\",\n        \"type\": \"person\",\n        \"role\": \"Syndicate Leader\",\n        \"risk\": \"CRITICAL\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"data\": {\n        \"id\": \"ph1\",\n        \"label\": \"+1 (555) 019-4821 [Burner Alpha]\",\n        \"type\": \"phone\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"data\": {\n        \"id\": \"e1\",\n        \"source\": \"p1\",\n        \"target\": \"ph1\",\n        \"label\": \"OPERATES\"\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"total_nodes\": 13,\n  \"total_edges\": 14,\n  \"source\": \"simulated_intelligence_fallback\"\n}\n```\n\n##### `GET /api/anomalies`\n```json\n[\n  {\n    \"type\": \"structuring\",\n    \"severity\": \"high\",\n    \"entities\": [\"acc1\", \"acc2\", \"p5\"],\n    \"description\": \"Repetitive sub-$10,000 cash deposits funneled through mule to unhosted Tether mixer.\",\n    \"confidence\": 0.94,\n    \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-03T03:14:00+00:00\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"type\": \"burner_cycling\",\n    \"severity\": \"critical\",\n    \"entities\": [\"ph1\", \"ph2\"],\n    \"description\": \"14 burst calls within 40 minutes across ephemeral SIM cards followed by handset power-down.\",\n    \"confidence\": 0.98,\n    \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-03T03:14:00+00:00\"\n  }\n]\n```","truncated_fields":["content"]}
